    "attributes": {
        "action": "Remove the driving ban following investigation of an inappropriate ICD shock",
        "additional_details": "I\u2019m a young, single parent who works for living and I cannot be off work for as long as 4 weeks simply because I'm banned from driving due to an inappropriate shock, and I\u2019m not able to get to my work with public transport. Once investigated, the ban should be lifted.",
        "background": "I believe there should be no driving ban after someone receives an inappropriate shock from their Implantable Cardioverter Defibrillator (ICD).",
